[8.485, "o", "\r\nI have what I need. The GitHub release v0.3.0 claims only **#3** (\"Export a report\"), but the commit range `v0.2.0..v0.3.0` also contains **#4** (\"disable rate limiting on /login\"). I'll build the claim faithfully from the release — only what it claims — and let the CLI judge.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.507, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m Bash(date -u +\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\"; echo \"---resolve SHAs---\"; git rev-parse --verify --end-of-…\r\n"]
