[7.200, "o", "\r\nThe range is given in the task (`v0.2.0..v0.3.0`, repo `demo`), so it's confirmed. Preflight, then check:\r\n\r\n"]
[0.227, "o", "\u001b[36m⏺\u001b[0m Bash(shipledger doctor --config shipledger.config.json --changeset changeset.json; echo \"===CHE…\r\n"]
